# The first machine-LEARNED candidate: evolve1's best member (g4m2,
# +4.197 at 8 pairs), from the CEM population search over the 4-unit
# ground simplex (scripts/evolve.py, rng 1, 6 generations x 16 members
# vs the close0-flame4 champion). The genome compiled into the
# champion's own army slots: the c_artillery slot became heavyTank --
# artillery-light heavy-armor, the mix the whole elite converged on and
# no hand-built doctrine ever fielded. Every knob is the champion's.
# Generation fitness is selection-biased at 8 pairs and adopts nothing;
# this faces the 48-pair win bar on untouched seeds (laws six, nine).
name evolve1-g4m2
